    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "64B056279C27961C",
      "text": "Ehilà! Ti stavo aspettando! Da qui parte\\nil percorso dello slalom.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "64B059279C279B35",
      "text": "Bisogna salire in groppa a un Pokémon e\\nscivolare lungo un percorso immerso nella natura.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "64B058279C279982",
      "text": "Se raggiungerai il traguardo entro il tempo\\nmassimo avrai superato l’esame!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "64B053279C279103",
      "text": "Allora, vuoi sottoporti all’Esame della Palestra?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "64B052279C278F50",
      "text": "Goditi il paesaggio immacolato! Si comincia!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DD846D70418449",
      "text": "Va bene",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DD816D70417F30",
      "text": "Come funziona?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "66DD826D704180E3",
      "text": "Annulla",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "64B055279C279469",
      "text": "Complimenti! Hai raggiunto il traguardo! Il tuo\\nstile di slalom era da ver[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa professionista!\\c\\nSembrava quasi di guardare Grusha ai tempi\\nd’oro...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "5BAE1046691347DE",
      "text": "Oh! E ovviamente hai superato l’esame\\nalla grande!\\c\\nVai a riferire l’esito allo staff all’entrata\\ndella palestra!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "64B054279C2792B6",
      "text": "Mi spiace, hai fallito l’esame! Ma guarda il lato\\npositivo: almeno non ti sei fatt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa male!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "64B05F279C27A567",
      "text": "Non preoccuparti, puoi sottoporti all’Esame\\ndella Palestra tutte le volte che vorrai!\\r\\nContinua a fare del tuo meglio senza arrenderti!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
